  "notes": "FORMAL REGISTER:\n{建|けん}{議|ぎ} is a formal word typically used in:\n- Government/administrative contexts\n- Business/corporate settings\n- Official recommendations to superiors\n\nCOMPARISON WITH SIMILAR WORDS:\n- {建|けん}{議|ぎ} - formal proposal (to authority)\n- {提案|ていあん} - proposal, suggestion (general)\n- {提言|ていげん} - recommendation, proposal (formal)\n- {意見|いけん} - opinion (general)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {建|けん}{議|ぎ}を{提出|ていしゅつ}する - to submit a proposal\n- {建|けん}{議|ぎ}{書|しょ} - written proposal/recommendation\n- {建|けん}{議|ぎ}を{受|う}け{入|い}れる - to accept a proposal",
